      "cooked": "<p>In MigrantP's <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/clarifications-and-decisions-from-handelabra-christophers-fireside-chats-6773\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">omnibus rules posting</a>, he states \"<span>“Reveal” and “Look at” mean the same thing.\" &nbsp;But neither of those terms are in the Glossary. &nbsp;So, what is the official definition of \"reveal\", please?</span></p><p><span>(unless you're MigrantP or Christopher, please don't post your opinion of what \"reveal\" means, unless you've got a link to an official ruling from one of those guys. &nbsp;I want to put the official, confirmed definition in the FAQ. &nbsp;Thanks.)</span></p>",
