      "raw": "<p>In MigrantP&#39;s <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/clarifications-and-decisions-from-handelabra-christophers-fireside-chats-6773\">omnibus rules posting</a>, he states &quot;<span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 'PT Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&ldquo;Reveal&rdquo; and &ldquo;Look at&rdquo; mean the same thing.&quot; &nbsp;But neither of those terms are in the Glossary. &nbsp;So, what is the official definition of &quot;reveal&quot;, please?</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: 'PT Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">(unless you&#39;re MigrantP or Christopher, please don&#39;t post your opinion of what &quot;reveal&quot; means, unless you&#39;ve got a link to an official ruling from one of those guys. &nbsp;I want to put the official, confirmed definition in the FAQ. &nbsp;Thanks.)</span></p>",
