      "raw": "[s]I don&#39;t have the exact quote, but[/s] I&#39;m sure that MigrantP has said somewhere that revealed cards go into their own special zone, and as such are not considered in the deck while they are revealed. &nbsp;Give me a moment to see if I can dig up the quote.\n\n&nbsp;\n\nEDIT: &nbsp;[url=https://greaterthangames.com/comment/97229#comment-97229]Got it![/url]\n\n[quote=\"MigrantP\"]\n\nAlexxKay is correct. In the digital version those cards would be in Parse&#39;s Revealed location, which is just another location like Deck, Trash, Hand, or InPlay.\n\n[/quote]\n\n",
