      "created_at": "2015-02-21T05:18:14.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>What you guys are saying makes perfect sense, but I'm going to be a pedant about it anyway. Just because the app has a special zone for revealed cards doesn't mean that's officially how the card game works. I only want to put it in the FAQ if it's officially how the card game works.&nbsp;</p>",
